Senior Frontend Engineer based in India 🇮🇳.


I work on the recurring problems — inconsistent
UI patterns, fragile components, design systems that never quite land in production. At [Full Creative](https://full.io) I lead the **Earth Design System**: stable APIs, accessible
primitives, and theming that holds up across marketing and product surfaces.

Before that, four
years building the sites and flows the system now serves.

I care about accessibility that survives contact with production, interaction design that handles
the awkward cases, component APIs that read well at the call site, and architectural decisions
that are still defensible three years later.

Currently interested in frontend platform work — shared foundations, not isolated features.
